              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Abantu b'omu Buyudaaya, bakoze ekibi ye ndi, nze Musengwa Katonda. Batoire emisambwa egyenhinhalwa, baagita mu isinzizo lyange, baalyonoona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.7.30",
