        {
          "text": " Mu bibuga bya Buyudaaya ni mu nguudo dha Yerusalemu, ndidha kulekeza emizira egy'abali mu binhumo ni mu kusagamba, ndekeze n'egy'abo abali mu mbaga edh'obugole kuba ensi eyo ya kufuuka bifulukwafulukwa omutaba bantu.”",
